(Attach any required documentation as specified by your insurance provider.)

Section 3: Instructions for Submitting
1. Print Section 2 and complete all required fields.
2. Attach any supporting documents (e.g., prescription, invoice, etc.).
3. Mail the completed form and attachments to your insurance provider at the address provided by your insurer.
4. Keep Section 1 and Section 3 for your records and reference.
5. Contact your insurance provider if you have questions about the reimbursement process.

Tip: Make a copy of everything you send for your records.
